  "reviewScope": "Frozen helper/controller/source ownership/UI and saved targeted receipts; no new test or production execution.",
  "findings": [],
  "reviewedMechanisms": [
    {
      "file": "src/runtime/xlsx_search_text.ts",
      "lines": "27-117",
      "conclusion": "Visible-saved-only scope and matching catalog required. Included visible noncovered cells emit decoded strings or original raw lexemes; formula text emitted only when included and stored. Empty strings/absent cache create no synthetic text. Each field/cell remains independent; no labels, attrs, formatted display, equals prefix, evaluation or shared-formula expansion."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/runtime/xlsx_search_text.ts",
      "lines": "56-97",
      "conclusion": "Rejects NUL/unpaired surrogate, counts actual UTF8 from saved segments, freezes copied location/warnings. Relationship id resolves stable sheet name, not numeric sheetId or index."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/runtime/attachment_search.ts",
      "lines": "401-444",
      "conclusion": "New bounded capture verifies exact7fields, enforces archive envelope limits, uses existing real readWorkbookInput in visible mode, shares DOCX parseTail, checks owner/cancel after each await and rechecks full source after parsing."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/runtime/attachment_search.ts",
      "lines": "450-563",
      "conclusion": "At most2capture tasks; compressed source never substitutes for extracted text budget. Ordered actualUTF8 aggregate<=16MiB; temporary text reservation waits rather than falsely spending failed reads. 200displayed hits preserves total count."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/runtime/attachment_search.ts",
      "lines": "245-286,586-625",
      "conclusion": "Cancellation/retire withdraw results and abort Worker wait; native operations retain own OS permits. Explicit retry only; navigation rechecks source, failures clear stale hits, no auto history/Agent action."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/runtime/attachment_search_source.ts",
      "lines": "65-144",
      "conclusion": "Source freshness includes attachment identity/URI/name/MIME, loaded thread and index ownership. XLSX declared MIME or path chooses parser; conflicting DOCX route unchanged, no fallback broadening."
    },
    {
      "file": "src/components/SelectedAttachmentSearch.tsx",
      "lines": "96-126,230-247,273-307",
      "conclusion": "Existing explicit selection/start ownership retained. Saved-cache freshness, partial-scope warning and scopeEmpty are visible outside folded details; location rendered as actual sheet/cell/field, body React escaped."
    }
  ],
